</span>
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_affiliation"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Affiliation: </span><span id="id7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Lomonosov Moscow State University (MSU), Moscow, Russia</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Viacheslav Vasilev
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_affiliation"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Affiliation: </span><span id="id8" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Sber AI, Moscow, Russia</span>
</span>
