</table>
</figure>
<figure id="S4.T2" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S4.T2.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 2</span>: </span><span id="S4.T2.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Model quality metrics after fine-tuning. NABLA variants maintain comparable performance to baseline even at <math id="S4.T2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="90\text{\,}\%" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>90</mn><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace="0.222em" mathsize="1.110em">%</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">90\text{\,}\%</annotation></semantics></math> sparsity.</span></figcaption>
